<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Welcome</title>
  </head>

  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    "
  >
    <div
      style="
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 12px;
      "
    >
      <h2>Welcome to Courier & Logistics 🎉</h2>

      <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>

      <p>
        Your account has been successfully created and your email has been
        verified.
      </p>

      <p>You can now login and use our courier and logistics services.</p>

      <div style="margin: 30px 0">
        <strong>Your account is now active.</strong>
      </div>

      <p>Thank you for joining us.</p>

      <hr />

      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #777">
        Courier & Logistics Management Platform
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
